WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.220
You're doing great. Just a little further to go. A few things to keep in mind

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:04.720
tonight.

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.120
If you haven't had a bowel movement yet after starting your prep, don't panic.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.480
It can take a couple of hours to kick in. Keep drinking your clear liquids and

5
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.160
stay patient.

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.540
Also, continue to avoid all solid foods and alcohol. And if you're on a split

7
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.160
dose prep,

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.530
your second dose is coming up. There's a separate video walking you through

9
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:23.920
that.

10
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.510
Lastly, before you go to sleep, confirm your arrival time with your driver for

11
00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:29.920
tomorrow.

12
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.640
You're doing everything right. Get some rest and we'll see you soon.
